<h3><u>Tamache Khaye</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haye sakina haye sakina - 2</p>

<p>Haaye mazluma haye sakina<br />
Haye masuma haye sakina</p>

<p>Haaye sakina<br />
Paani masuma me maanga to tamache khaaye - 2</p>

<p>Paani masuma ne maanga to tamache khaaye - 2<br />
Roke baba ko bulaya to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>1. Chinne aaya jo zainab ki rida bacchi ne - 2<br />
Shimr ko rokna chaha to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>2. Jalte khayme se nikalte hue shehzadi ne - 2<br />
Raasta pucha najaf ka to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>3. Dhundti thi wo tamacho ki shikayat ke liye - 2<br />
Mil gaya baap ka laasha to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>4. Gir gayi thi wo kahi chalte hue naake se - 2<br />
Shimr jab dhund ke laaya to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>5. Apne chehro ko tamacho se bachane ke liye - 2<br />
Nanhe haatho se chupaya to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>6. Ye to accha hi hua dil me kaha karti thi - 2<br />
Naa rahe jab mere baba to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>7. Khaaye zainab ne kayi durre bhatije ke liye - 2<br />
Isne baqir ko bachaya to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>8. Kufao shaam ke bazaro me chalte chalte - 2<br />
Thak ke baythi jo sakina to tamache khaaye</p>

<p>9. Mir sajjad sakina bhi hai zahra ki tarha - 2<br />
Ho gayi jab ye yateema to tamache khaaye</p>
</p>
